You can always engrave "Elbereth" and levitate over the engraving, or 
drop a scare monster scroll. The monster will move next to you but won't 
hit you. You can then get a hit in before it runs away. If it runs away 
in the right direction you can get it with missile weapons. Eventually you 
will kill it and get your stormbringer (without ever taking a hit).

